OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after two die in
OL,4,Apolice pursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with causing the
OL,7,Fdeath of two people by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving after a fatal crash in Leeds.
OL,10,FLeigh Ross, 39, is due to appear at
OL,11,FLeeds Magistrates' Court later after
OL,12,Fthe crash at the junction of Gelderd
OL,13,FRoad and Lowfields Road at 00:44 GMT on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,17,Fwere following a blue BMW 123D when it
OL,18,Ffailed to stop and crashed into a white
OL,19,FVolkswagen Scirocco. The driver of the
OL,20,FVW, a man aged 22, died at the scene. A
OL,21,F23-year-old female passenger died later
OL,22,Fin hospital. Both were from York.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
